@@ -239,6 +239,10 @@ The following extra parameters are supported:
     --8<-- "vllm/entrypoints/openai/protocol.py:chat-completion-extra-params"
     ```
 
+  When `return_routed_experts=true`, the final non-streaming chat response may
+  include `choices[*].routed_experts` as a vLLM-specific extension field.
+  This field is not part of the OpenAI API specification.
+
 ### Responses API
 
 Our Responses API is compatible with [OpenAI's Responses API](https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/responses);
